    <l n="35" type="diagram" level="4">4. Completum seu totum,</l>
    <l n="36" type="diagram" level="4">5. Voce distincta ac certa significatum.</l>
    <l n="37" type="diagram" level="3">2. Analogus. Atque ita ad ordinem praedicamentalem refertur Deus.</l>
    <l n="38" type="diagram" level="3">3. Collateralis: vt Differentia.</l>
    <l n="39" type="diagram" level="3">4. Indirectus: Reductiue autem in praedicamentis esse dicitur</l>
