    <l n="41" type="diagram" level="4">2. Partes cuiusque totius.</l>
    <l n="42" type="diagram" level="3">5. Per accidens: &amp; sicad praedicamentales ordines pertinent,</l>
    <l n="43" type="diagram" level="4">1. Entia complexa,</l>
    <l n="44" type="diagram" level="4">2. Entia intentionalia extra mentem,</l>
    <l n="45" type="diagram" level="4">3. Notiones secundae,</l>
    <l n="46" type="diagram" level="4">4. Relationes rationis,</l>
